e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iQ9-x9cnYD8Q7kNvwE38ccn&_nc_oc=AdqdV_WmFd1aAKoSUsSPgNTHNsNnE5UKmBuVlYYGGKlIe7fCqj-QXjp1eZRx2fs69Rc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIDvoAKY4pOBxluJEXP4VMkBTHdArb5CSiwG4KUXaE7w&oe=6AD38F79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AnsmZyVZpRwQ7kNvwEf9Vbq&_nc_oc=AdpLNbuch02j_kuld_KRCLxnlXee_TIdAL4G92YLqeLcFBGnR92RJgbiiwwYeZyHYxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHSSWrlAGErR8yIBX2QvywymkXi_4lDfrwk1Y1nyovaA&oe=6AD39F13"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QLOyayaMSMcQ7kNvwHOWS9N&_nc_oc=AdqaeZsLJkthxNeWsKBcdkSbacZNR1aZ1hG0QoKgdjRL7vbM2GFTFUsXjeaRQllqeeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMxdNeQCPXaQnQJuhXhwn6xK8nGamD-KrQ5C4vWBtAsUg&oe=6AD3AABB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SB6yKFwJqhIQ7kNvwH3ff-B&_nc_oc=AdpFzGC7_aMDr0gw0lQjoXdOSZtkhjV77efzzyZpoYfDPvQNByazKKTRWS0ZtC51qFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO7p0hlTEwCnOHmCkpUaHbl7C9aJzDZiPiSY5mtbeSEtA&oe=6AD3AC0A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-m9_FRPZxBQQ7kNvwG_BCIa&_nc_oc=AdrvOhbsUMn2AAt5v7v0Xhkt3f1em4ePpG1CKPhBGqvv7FUTrfoR-P24zaQyHdx12g0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMiNl3HNbPPI-AmAIlp7LeWtyUDMSA6uxOSjwnolMqvcA&oe=6AD3953E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se